---
layout: base.njk
title: "Camwyn & Co — Big Ideas. Good Company."
description: "Camwyn & Co is the home of Mema's Inclination and a growing collection of experiments and worthwhile (ad)ventures."
---

<!-- Structured Data (JSON-LD Organization & WebSite) -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization",
      "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
      "url": "{{ site.url }}",
      "logo": "{{ site.url }}/assets/logo.svg",
      "description": "An independent house of projects, ventures, experiments, and worthwhile adventures.",
      "email": "{{ site.contactEmail }}",
      "founder": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Stephen Page",
          "alternateName": "Camwyn",
          "url": "{{ site.url }}/our-story/"
        },
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Ivy Page",
          "alternateName": "Mema",
          "url": "{{ site.url }}/our-story/"
        }
      ],
      "sameAs": [
        "https://github.com/Camwyn"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#website",
      "url": "{{ site.url }}",
      "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
      "description": {{ site.tagline | dump | safe }},
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#organization"
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="c-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">
      <span x-show="!$store.compass.result">An independent house of projects</span>
      <span x-show="$store.compass.result" x-cloak>
        Greetings, <strong x-text="$store.compass.archetypes[$store.compass.result]?.id"></strong> · Your compass is set
      </span>
    </p>
    
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="c-hero__title">
      A place<br>
      for <span class="c-hero__title-accent">good</span><br>
      things<br>
      to take<br>
      shape.
    </h1>

    <div class="c-hero__footer">
      <div>
        <p class="c-hero__lead">
          Camwyn &amp; Co is the home of Mema's Inclination and a growing collection of experiments and worthwhile (ad)ventures.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="c-hero__callout">
        <p class="c-hero__tag">One roof.<br>Many paths.<br>Plenty of room.</p>
        <a href="#your-compass" class="c-hero__anchor">
          Start here <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Story Summary Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-bg-surface u-border-top" id="our-story" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid">
      <div style="grid-column: span 7; padding-right: var(--space-lg);">
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Our point of view</p>
        <h2 id="story-heading" class="c-hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 4.25rem);">
          Not a<br>traditional<br>company<br>story.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div style="grid-column: span 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
        <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--color-on-surface); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Some companies begin with a plan. Ours began with <span class="u-text-clay">curiosity, family, and the belief that the best work still feels personal.</span>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          Camwyn &amp; Co brings many projects under one roof. Each gets room for its own voice, while sharing the same roots: care, usefulness, imagination, and a healthy refusal to become too polished.
        </p>
        <div style="border-left: 2px solid var(--color-muted-clay); padding-left: var(--space-md);">
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Our working theory</p>
          <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-primary);">
            Smart can be warm.<br>
            Ambition can have soul.<br>
            Serious work can still be fun.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Interactive Adventure Compass Quiz -->
{% include "compass.njk" %}

<!-- What We're Building Section -->
{% include "projects-list.njk" %}

<!-- Notes From The Field Section -->
